<h1>Welcome to Lost & Found!</h1>

<p>Hi <%= @user.email.split('@').first.capitalize %>,</p>

<p>
  Welcome to <strong>Lost & Found</strong> — a simple way to report lost items,
  share found items, and help reunite people with their belongings.
</p>

<p>With your account, you can:</p>

<ul>
  <li>Report an item you've lost</li>
  <li>Post an item you've found</li>
  <li>Browse reported lost and found items</li>
  <li>Comment on items to help connect with their owners</li>
</ul>

<p>
  We hope you'll never lose anything — but if you do, we're here to help.
</p>

<p>
  <strong>Ready to get started?</strong><br>
  Log in to your account and start exploring.
</p>

<p>
  Thanks for joining us!<br>
  <strong>The Lost & Found Team</strong>
</p>
